      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ある日の午後、森を巡回していた僕たちは\n遭遇した侵入者たちと戦い、撃退に成功した。\n僕は奮戦したモンスター娘たちに労いの言葉をかけていく。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "b6c215db557a45bcde1d295e4cbf5d1cb993e5de381ae353742c88e0b05125cb",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "バウさんもお疲れ様でした！\nバウさんが、あそこで敵を抑えてくれたおかげで、\nかなり有利に戦うことができましたよ！",
      "jp_sha256": "0133b660657de561a96868c9bf4604b41336d3723777c710cacc420b9bb0e820",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "바우 씨도 수고하셨어요!\n바우 씨가 그곳에서 적을 막아 준 덕분에,\n상당히 유리하게 싸울 수 있었어요!",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "eb8d72ffe3e5e151dc88eb7e78cf827996d05da3acb04276f0feb81b27b9f3d7:000002_706165509437679770:g0:r10",
      "row_index_0based": 10,
      "serialized_row_index": 10,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "バウさんもお疲れ様でした！\nバウさんが、あそこで敵を抑えてくれたおかげで、\nかなり有利に戦うことができましたよ！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
